*.pyc
*.gif
node_modules/
tests/
scripts/
data/
# ...except the highlight pool, which the bot reads at runtime. Excluding
# the directory and then COPYing a file out of it does not fail loudly at
# runtime — it fails the build, which on Render means the old container
# keeps serving and the deploy is "done" as far as anyone watching the URL
# can tell. tests/test_docker_build_context.py checks the two files agree.
!data/highlights.json
!data/term_index.json
# The clipper's source of the media URL and the per-second segments.
# Gzipped because the raw file is 7.6MB and every ingest rewrites it.
!data/episodes.json.gz
!data/elon_episodes.json.gz
redteam_report.md
PITCH_PREP.md
